ter  losing eleven will is in therapy for his  upside down ptsd with a scientist named  dr owens and this conspiracy nut named  murray bauman is convinced that russians  have invaded hawkins and then there's  billy hargrove max's violent piece of  [ __ ] stepbrother also crops are dying in  fields all over hawkins and it's clearly  connected somehow to the upside down it  turns out that the gate has been  reopened deep in the earth beneath the  lap after bob has a heart to heart with  will encouraging him to face the monster  and his recurring nightmares head on he  decides to face it that night in his  sleep unfortunately he's possessed by an  even scarier creature called the mind  flayer in d d the mind player is a  powerful sadistic psionic creature who  believed all human life to be beneath  him and sought the destruction of the  forgotten realms in hawkins indiana its  hive mind wants to spread like a virus  and destroy every realm in every  universe it invades will's mind and body  and it's discovered that the mind flayer  likes it cold and hates the heat he has  a direct link to the upside down and can  think and feel everything that the  monster does he begins drawing creepy  shadowy vines and when joyce puts the  sketches together she and hopper realize  that the vines represent an opening to  the upside down located at the local  pumpkin patch mike convinces will to be  a spy and use his connection to the mind  flayer to keep the party posted on its  plans another new creature dubbed a  demidog makes its way to dustin who  adopts him feeds him nougat and names  him dartanian after the three musketeers  when it grows large enough it also  escapes to the upside down will is  hospitalized and they realize that the  only way to kill the vines is to get the  mind flare out of him first but after  burning the vines and therefore injuring  both will and the monster will is  possessed to betray the location of his  friends and family side quests there's  also a b-