l give him a number  to plank's constant  disease  [Music]  unfortunately  hopper is standing next to the machine  when joyce is forced to shut it down and  close the gate and is seemingly  disintegrated the upside down closes but  billy is trying to sacrifice eleven to  the mind flayer back at star court mall  she taps into his memories of his mother  from when he was a child and the love he  once had for his mom compels him to  sacrifice himself to the monster the  mind flayer dies when the gate is fully  closed three months later the buyers and  11 are moving away from hawkins and the  kids say a tearful goodbye ellen mike  promised to stay in touch and will says  he'll play d and d with the boys the  next time he's in town eleven finds a  last letter from hopper that he wrote to  her when she and mike were making out  nonstop in it he says that he loves her  and it's kind of the perfect send-off  for his character but over in russia  these comrades are still working with  demogorgons feeding them prisoners from  within their base and a teaser trailer  that came out in 2020 confirmed that yes  daddy hopper is still alive he's just  trapped into jail overseas with a bunch  of guys who want to destroy the world of  demogorgons then now you're all caught  up for season four follow me on  instagram and twitter whitneypuppy  follow new rockstars subscribe to new  rockstars for more analysis of  everything you love and thanks for  watching bye  [Music]  you

